																								<r3d:remarks>In 2008 World Data Centers in Russia and Ukraine have united in the Russian-Ukrainian segment of the World Data System. WDCs provide a free access of scientific organizations and scientists to data of planetary geophysics and sustainable development. Details of the WDCs in Russia and Ukraine are given on their Web-sites.  WDC in Ukraine is created in the structure of the Institute for Applied Systems Analysis and the National Technical University of Ukraine &quot;Kiev Polytechnical Institute&quot; in 2006. This WDC is situated in Kiev. World Data Center for Geoinformatics and Sustainable Development is a regular member of the ISC Wolrd Data System.</r3d:remarks>
